# Google Gemini API Key (optional — entered by each user in the app UI)
# Users can get a FREE Gemini API key from Google AI Studio:
# https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# No credit card required. The free tier is very generous.
#
# The API key is stored client-side in the user's browser localStorage.
# It is never sent to the backend canister.
#
# Image generation uses Pollinations.ai (completely free, no key needed).
